        199.97694396972656,
        519.2850952148438,
        208.82373046875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "in Figure 1(b), and sp is the overall path length. We can reparameterize by time with",
      "bbox": [
